# Credentials — this repo is PUBLIC. Belt and braces: each of these is also
# ignored by a subdirectory .gitignore, but a moved or newly added file must
# never depend on that. Real values live in ~/.doqto/ or terraform.tfvars.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
key.properties
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
secrets.json
# Chrome's download directory points here; downloaded config lands in it.
credentials/
